[ti:O Little Town of Bethlehem]
[ar:Traditional]
[00:00.00]O little town of Bethlehem
[00:06.74]How still we see thee lie
[00:13.48]Above thy deep and dreamless sleep
[00:21.08]The silent stars go by
[00:28.68]Yet in thy dark streets shineth
[00:36.46]The everlasting light
[00:44.24]The hopes and fears of all the years
[00:55.50]Are met in thee tonight
